          "title": "智譜 在其編碼方案中推出 GLM-5.4，具備視覺功能且每週配額增加 50% / Z.ai launches GLM-5.4 in its Coding Plan with vision and 50% more weekly quota",
          "title_zh": "智譜 在其編碼方案中推出 GLM-5.4，具備視覺功能且每週配額增加 50%",
          "title_en": "Z.ai launches GLM-5.4 in its Coding Plan with vision and 50% more weekly quota",
          "title_original": "Z.ai launches GLM-5.4 in its Coding Plan with vision and 50% more weekly quota",
          "summary": "Hours after the launch, Zixuan Li said internal evals show a large gain over GLM-5.3 on test writing, code QA and core development work, and told users to save GLM-5.4 for hard problems because its long thinking mode is overkill for one-liners.",
          "summary_zh": "發表數小時後，李梓萱表示內部評估顯示，在測試寫作、程式碼品保和核心開發工作方面，相較於 GLM-5.3 取得重大進展，並告訴用戶將 GLM-5.4 留給艱難的問題，因為其長時間思考模式對於單行程式碼來說大材小用。",
